      "side": 1,
      "message": "We have a 4-second timer for startup timer.  If it takes more than 0.5 seconds to find the HAL when we know it exists, we will get a lot of bugs about Bluetooth starting slowly.  In order to avoid that, we set a timer to point out that the system started Bluetooth without starting the HAL first.",
      "range": {
